flowchart TD
    Start([Start: TICViewAssignedQueries]) --> Input[/Input: tic_id/]
    Input --> QUsers[(Query USERS & ROLE Tables)]
    QUsers --> CheckRole{Role == TIC?}
    
    CheckRole -- No --> Err1[/Return Error: Unauthorized/]
    CheckRole -- Yes --> QQueries[(Query D3: QUERIES where assigned_tic = tic_id)]
    QQueries --> Sort[Sort by updated_at descending]
    Sort --> LoopStart{More queries to process?}
    
    LoopStart -- Yes --> QStudent[(Query USERS: student_id)]
    QStudent --> Combine[Combine query + student details]
    Combine --> InsertList[Insert into tic_dashboard_view]
    InsertList --> LoopStart
    
    LoopStart -- No --> Output[/Return Success: tic_dashboard_view/]
    Output --> End([End])
    
    Err1 --> End